  "description": "A high-performance Razor Class Library for Umbraco 17 (.NET 10) that integrates Instagram feeds using the official Instagram Graph API (v21.0). \n      Features automatic Umbraco dictionary item seeding through package migration, secure configuration of Instagram Access Token and User ID via \n      Umbraco Dictionary keys, zero-config dependency injection registration through InstagramComposer, and strongly typed C# models for Instagram \n      profile data and media items including images, reels, and carousel albums with captions, like counts, comment counts, thumbnails, media URLs, \n      and permalinks.",
